00:12:10,333 --> 00:12:17,323
foundry partners to find ways to get extremely high bandwidth access to higher capacity memories.

146
00:12:17,373 --> 00:12:23,520
So, for the past couple of years, we've been involved in these kind of skunk works projects to move away from SRAM,

147
00:12:23,570 --> 00:12:29,989
you know, looking at how we can get, for instance, much, much, much higher bandwidth to DRAM memories.

148
00:12:30,039 --> 00:12:33,869
