00:12:38,920 --> 00:12:42,552
um which uh kind of unites, I guess,

151
00:12:42,602 --> 00:12:50,128
the scalability of these kind of higher capacity, lower cost DRAM memories that you have on a GPU,

152
00:12:50,178 --> 00:12:56,212
on a TPU, uh with all of the speed advantages that you get from a Groq chip or a Cerebras chip.

153
00:12:56,262 --> 00:13:05,510
Um and I think where we see this is especially vital is you know, if you look at where it is that speed really moves the dial today,

