00:13:11,230 --> 00:13:18,252
when um uh Henry Ford sort of asked the rhetorical question of what people would have said they wanted and you know,

157
00:13:18,302 --> 00:13:20,431
faster horses uh rather than a car.

158
00:13:20,481 --> 00:13:24,846
Uh the snap your chatbot is kind of the faster horses of kind of fast inference.

